    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/c221563cd06db30f1eb8426540d73b32.webp?t=1744268399\" width=553 height=50 /></span><br><br>A thorough crackdown on the underworld has been initiated by the City Hall of Serbia! Koushuk the former leader of the Black Shadow gang, loses everything in this catastrophic operation. However, through a fortunate turn of events,Koushuk becomes an unofficial member of the police force, working as an undercover cop.<br><br>However, due to recent reports of a serial killer on the loose, people in this small town, within the jurisdiction area, are highly vigilant. During an investigation, Kosatsuki encounters the enigmatic detective girl, Yana Mai.<br><br>Amidst the presence of cult followers, the peculiar town, the impending threat of the serial killer, and the conspiracy of the Crimson Lotus Society, the fate of these two girls intertwines. As they navigate through countless events, their ultimate destiny remains uncertain.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/29ff75125c405cea28faf96f3b79890c.webp?t=1744268399\" width=553 height=50 /></span><br><br>Experience an immersive gameplay of over 20 hours with a rich storyline, extensive side quests, and engaging missions.<br><br>Engage in thrilling battles using the intricate Dragonbone combat system, accompanied by stunning skill performances. Each character boasts unique and adorable models and animations!<br><br>Explore a variety of gameplay mechanics, including gathering, alchemy, cooking, item appraisal, and skill trees, ensuring a diverse range of activities to fulfill your gaming desires.<br><br>With the inclusion of a dynamic time system, the world undergoes different changes as day turns into night.<br><br>Prepare for multiple endings! The game offers both a regular ending route and a true ending route, adding depth and replayability to the overall experience.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/368596b480dcb113bed63c5b6f224483.webp?t=1744268399\" width=553 height=50 /></span><br><br>20 hours and more<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/dc512824036d58b752b5bbcff6ac27b2.webp?t=1744268399\" width=553 height=50 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/73de9fe5e46fc9a0d08d39f187183228.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Gu shuoyue ]Combat cv\uff1aother<br>Once a gang girl, Kosatsuki now serves as an unofficial police officer, ensuring law and order in Serbia.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/42dab63b97e5bb42719f8b2c404cb3e0.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Banaime]Combat cv\uff1aother<br>Self-proclaimed amateur journalist, alchemist, occultist, and archaeologist detective girl.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/8edacd21d399bfa2b2ba95674d9fd3b7.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Hecate]Combat cv\uff1aNone<br>A girl who comes to the aid of Kosatsuki in times of crisis, but her true identity remains unknown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/a9bf317f017bd8cb4c7b1a90c1ee1c64.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Shiro]<br>A mysterious girl whose true intentions remain elusive. What is her ultimate goal?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/d7f3145ac5faacb285b9f6e17ccd8715.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Mysterious Girl]cv\uff1a\u9752\u6728\u9633\u83dc<br>\u2026\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/6e65ccdb051600b45f753d7b3c8c9333.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Anna]Combat cv\uff1a\u95f2\u8e0f\u68a7\u6850<br>A close friend of Kosatsuki, who inherits her father's cake shop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/d8f1f70f460cc51f893fa25ae17b5eab.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Lucy]Combat cv\uff1a\u95f2\u8e0f\u68a7\u6850<br>A wealthy heiress from Arkham City, currently searching for her missing brother.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/67384b7c7df7b8e5e9d27ec7d24caf92.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Mephis]Combat cv\uff1a\u95f2\u8e0f\u68a7\u6850<br>The demons of ancient times.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/c221563cd06db30f1eb8426540d73b32.webp?t=1744268399\" width=553 height=50 /></span><br><br>A thorough crackdown on the underworld has been initiated by the City Hall of Serbia! Koushuk the former leader of the Black Shadow gang, loses everything in this catastrophic operation. However, through a fortunate turn of events,Koushuk becomes an unofficial member of the police force, working as an undercover cop.<br><br>However, due to recent reports of a serial killer on the loose, people in this small town, within the jurisdiction area, are highly vigilant. During an investigation, Kosatsuki encounters the enigmatic detective girl, Yana Mai.<br><br>Amidst the presence of cult followers, the peculiar town, the impending threat of the serial killer, and the conspiracy of the Crimson Lotus Society, the fate of these two girls intertwines. As they navigate through countless events, their ultimate destiny remains uncertain.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/29ff75125c405cea28faf96f3b79890c.webp?t=1744268399\" width=553 height=50 /></span><br><br>Experience an immersive gameplay of over 20 hours with a rich storyline, extensive side quests, and engaging missions.<br><br>Engage in thrilling battles using the intricate Dragonbone combat system, accompanied by stunning skill performances. Each character boasts unique and adorable models and animations!<br><br>Explore a variety of gameplay mechanics, including gathering, alchemy, cooking, item appraisal, and skill trees, ensuring a diverse range of activities to fulfill your gaming desires.<br><br>With the inclusion of a dynamic time system, the world undergoes different changes as day turns into night.<br><br>Prepare for multiple endings! The game offers both a regular ending route and a true ending route, adding depth and replayability to the overall experience.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/368596b480dcb113bed63c5b6f224483.webp?t=1744268399\" width=553 height=50 /></span><br><br>20 hours and more<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/dc512824036d58b752b5bbcff6ac27b2.webp?t=1744268399\" width=553 height=50 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/73de9fe5e46fc9a0d08d39f187183228.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Gu shuoyue ]Combat cv\uff1aother<br>Once a gang girl, Kosatsuki now serves as an unofficial police officer, ensuring law and order in Serbia.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/42dab63b97e5bb42719f8b2c404cb3e0.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Banaime]Combat cv\uff1aother<br>Self-proclaimed amateur journalist, alchemist, occultist, and archaeologist detective girl.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/8edacd21d399bfa2b2ba95674d9fd3b7.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Hecate]Combat cv\uff1aNone<br>A girl who comes to the aid of Kosatsuki in times of crisis, but her true identity remains unknown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729360/extras/a9bf317f017bd8cb4c7b1a90c1ee1c64.avif?t=1744268399\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>[Shiro]<br>A mysterious girl whose true intentions remain elusive. What is